ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Sabías que estuve viviendo en un
pueblo llamado {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0002:0000}} unos
cuantos años?
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Allí conocí a {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}, {{TAG:000E:0005:040075006E00060075006E006100}} bue{{TAG:000E:0005:02006E0004006E006100}}
amig{{TAG:000E:0005:02006F0002006100}} mí{{TAG:000E:0005:02006F0002006100}} con quien me llevaba de
maravilla.
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Era {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0004:0000}}
de cabo a rabo. ¡Qué recuerdos!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}¿Qué estará haciendo ahora?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu, {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} kişisinden; {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}
kasabasında yaşıyor.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:000E:0005:0600680069006D000600680065007200}} kişisini tanıyor musun?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Neyse,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} eski usul
mektup gönderip almak çok eğlenceli.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Bu yüzden bunu sana gösteriyorum.
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Umarım seninle mektup arkadaşı
olabiliriz, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}O yüzden {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}bana
bir mektup gönder—{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}söz, ben de cevap yazarım!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Ja, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}so geht die Melodie!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Hach!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Da werden Erinnerungen wach.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Wie sich {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}} inzwischen
verändert haben mag?
